# Copy to `.env` for local dev with `pnpm dev` (Vite loads it automatically).
# Left blank/commented by default so local dev doesn't send tracking events —
# only set these against a real Umami instance if you want to test tracking locally.

# Umami has no host port of its own — it's reached through the `proxy` service's
# :80, which dispatches /umami/ to it (see docker-compose.yml and proxy/nginx.conf).
# VITE_UMAMI_SRC=http://localhost/umami/script.js
# VITE_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=
